### Get a substitution property
GET {{baseUrl}}/stewards/{{steward}}/models/{{model}}/versions/{{version}}/{{properties}}/{{substitution_qname}}

### Get an attribute property
GET {{baseUrl}}/stewards/{{steward}}/models/{{model}}/versions/{{version}}/{{properties}}/{{attribute_qname}}

### Get an object property
GET {{baseUrl}}/stewards/{{steward}}/models/{{model}}/versions/{{version}}/{{properties}}/{{object_qname}}

### Get an object property in XML
GET {{baseUrl}}/stewards/{{steward}}/models/{{model}}/versions/{{version}}/{{properties}}/{{object_qname}}?mediaType=xml

### Get an object property in CMF XML
